    <Speech UniqueID="InvisibleStrain_Diagnose" x="8663.809" y="-6281.244" NativeText="I've been thinking of a way to diagnose it actually.  If I'm correct, the infection must be attacking the limbic system but not the rest of the neocortex - they can still seem self-aware but their ability to feel emotions and experience emotional empathy is broken down.">
      <PriorityTerms>
