    </Speech>
    <Speech UniqueID="InvisibleStrain_Hypothetical" x="9641.088" y="-6356.38525" NativeText="So propose to them a hypothetical situation designed to trigger an emotional empathetic response and watch them to see how they react.  Their facial expressions may give them away!">
